---

<BaseLayout
  title="福利中心：限时折扣码与免费签到活动 - 机场指南针"
  description="汇集2026全网优质机场独家优惠券、折扣码、免费白嫖试用活动及签到领流量教程，领券直达立减！"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbItems} />

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <div class="my-8 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-300 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-500/20 mb-3">
        <Sparkles class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500" />
        <span>EXCLUSIVE COUPONS & FREE NODES</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        福利中心与限时折扣码
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        本站独家合作优惠券，下单结账输入即享专属立减。所有优惠码均经过实测校验，保证 100% 可用。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 优惠券网格 -->
    <section class="my-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      {coupons.map((c) => (
        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl glass-card border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-all">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="text-2xl">{c.logo}</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">{c.airportName}</h3>
              </div>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-black bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20">
                {c.discount}
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/5 border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
              <div>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block">独家立减优惠码</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-base font-extrabold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 tracking-wider">
                  {c.code}
                </span>
              </div>
              
              <button
                type="button"
                class="copy-coupon-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs hover:bg-amber-400 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                data-coupon={c.code}
                data-discount={c.discount}
              >
                <Copy class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
                <span>复制</span>
              </button>
            </div>

            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">
              💡 {c.highlight}
            </p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
              适用范围：{c.scope}
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-slate-400">
              <Clock class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
              <span>有效期至 {c.expiry}</span>
            </span>
            <a
              href={c.affiliateUrl}
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline"
            >
              <span>前往使用</span>
              <ExternalLink class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </section>

    <!-- 免费白嫖与签到活动指南 -->
    <section class="my-16 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-50 dark:from-surface-900 to-sky-50 dark:to-slate-900 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-indigo-600 text-white mb-3">
          <Gift class="w-4 h-4" />
          <span>免费白嫖机制说明</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">
          如何获取完全免费的应急节点与试用流量？
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          许多优质机场针对新注册用户提供免费体验策略（例如注册赠送 5G~10G 流量，或每日在网页后台签到抽奖获取 1G~5G 免费专线流量）。对于只是轻度查阅学术资料、收取邮件的用户，完全可以零成本长期使用。
        </p>
        <a
          href="/rankings/cheap-airports"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 shadow-md transition-all"
        >
          <span>查看当前可用的免费/试用机场列表</span>
          <ExternalLink class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

